<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Random Joke Generator</title>
<style>
  body {
    font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #333;
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 20px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f5f7fa 0%, #c3cfe2 100%);
  }
  
  .container {
    background-color: #fff;
    border-radius: 10px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    padding: 30px;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }
  
  .header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    position: relative;
    animation: fadeIn 1s ease-in-out;
  }
  
  h1 {
    font-size: 3rem;
    background: linear-gradient(45deg, #4285f4, #34a853, #fbbc05, #ea4335);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  
  .emoji {
    font-size: 3rem;
    display: inline-block;
    animation: bounce 2s infinite;
  }
  
  .badges {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin: 20px 0;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  
  .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 5px 10px;
    border-radius: 50px;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    margin: 5px;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  }
  
  .preview {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    margin: 30px 0;
    perspective: 1000px;
  }
  
  .preview img {
    max-width: 100%;
    border-radius: 10px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    transform: rotateY(5deg);
    transition: transform 0.5s;
    border: 5px solid white;
  }
  
  .preview img:hover {
    transform: rotateY(0);
  }
  
  h2 {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    margin-top: 40px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    color: #4285f4;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #f0f0f0;
    padding-bottom: 10px;
  }
  
  ul, ol {
    margin-left: 20px;
  }
  
  li {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  
  code {
    background-color: #f5f5f5;
    padding: 3px 6px;
    border-radius: 3px;
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  
  pre {
    background-color: #f5f5f5;
    padding: 15px;
    border-radius: 5px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
    margin: 15px 0;
  }
  
  .features {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
    margin: 30px 0;
  }
  
  .feature {
    background-color: #f8f9fa;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 20px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
    transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
  }
  
  .feature:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  }
  
  .feature-icon {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    display: block;
  }
  
  .feature h3 {
    margin-top: 0;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    color: #333;
  }
  
  .steps {
    counter-reset: step-counter;
    margin: 30px 0;
  }
  
  .step {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    padding-left: 60px;
    position: relative;
  }
  
  .step::before {
    counter-increment: step-counter;
    content: counter(step-counter);
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    background-color: #4285f4;
    color: white;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }
  
  .footer {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 50px;
    padding-top: 20px;
    border-top: 1px solid #eee;
    font-style: italic;
  }
  
  .heart {
    color: #ea4335;
    display: inline-block;
    animation: pulse 1.5s infinite;
  }
  
  @keyframes pulse {
    0% { transform: scale(1); }
    50% { transform: scale(1.2); }
    100% { transform: scale(1); }
  }
  
  @keyframes bounce {
    0%, 20%, 50%, 80%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
    40% { transform: translateY(-20px); }
    60% { transform: translateY(-10px); }
  }
  
  @keyframes fadeIn {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-20px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }
  
  .blue-badge { background-color: #4285f4; }
  .yellow-badge { background-color: #fbbc05; }
  .green-badge { background-color: #34a853; }
  .red-badge { background-color: #ea4335; }
  
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; }
    .features { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .preview img { transform: none; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="container">
  <div class="header">
    <span class="emoji">😂</span>
    <h1>Random Joke Generator</h1>
    <p>Brighten your day with a laugh at the click of a button!</p>
    
    <div class="badges">
      <a href="#" class="badge blue-badge">GitHub license: MIT</a>
      <a href="#" class="badge yellow-badge">Stars: ⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️</a>
      <a href="#" class="badge green-badge">Jokes: Unlimited</a>
      <a href="#" class="badge red-badge">Made with ❤️</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  
  <div class="preview">
    <img src="https://i.imgur.com/OYYlcDG.png" alt="Random Joke Generator Preview">
  </div>
  
  <h2>✨ Features</h2>
  <div class="features">
    <div class="feature">
      <span class="feature-icon">🔄</span>
      <h3>Diverse Joke Collection</h3>
      <p>Access jokes across multiple categories including Programming, Dark, Pun, and more!</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature">
      <span class="feature-icon">⚙️</span>
      <h3>Customizable Experience</h3>
      <p>Filter jokes by category, type, and language to match your mood and preferences.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature">
      <span class="feature-icon">🛡️</span>
      <h3>Content Control</h3>
      <p>Easily blacklist sensitive content with checkboxes for NSFW, religious, political and other flags.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature">
      <span class="feature-icon">💅</span>
      <h3>Elegant Design</h3>
      <p>Clean, responsive interface that works beautifully on all devices.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  
  <h2>🚀 Live Demo</h2>
  <p>Check out the live demo <a href="https://deviljerry.github.io/random-joke-generator">here</a>!</p>
  
  <h2>🛠️ Technologies Used</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>HTML5</li>
    <li>CSS3</li>
    <li>Vanilla JavaScript</li>
    <li><a href="https://jokeapi.dev/">JokeAPI</a> - A robust API for programming and general jokes</li>
  </ul>
  
  <h2>💻 Installation</h2>
  <p>Get up and running with these simple steps:</p>
  
  <div class="steps">
    <div class="step">
      <h3>Clone the repository</h3>
      <pre><code>git clone https://github.com/deviljerry/random-joke-generator.git</code></pre>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <h3>Navigate to the project directory</h3>
      <pre><code>cd random-joke-generator</code></pre>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <h3>Open index.html in your browser</h3>
      <pre><code>open index.html</code></pre>
    </div>
  </div>
  
  <p>That's it! No dependencies or complicated setup required. Just pure HTML, CSS, and JavaScript magic! ✨</p>
  
  <h2>🎮 How to Use</h2>
  <ol>
    <li><strong>Select your preferences</strong> from the dropdown menus:
      <ul>
        <li>Choose a joke category (Programming, Misc, Dark, etc.)</li>
        <li>Select joke type (Single or Two-part)</li>
        <li>Pick your preferred language</li>
      </ul>
    </li>
    <li><strong>Set content filters</strong> by checking any topics you'd like to avoid</li>
    <li><strong>Click "Get a Joke"</strong> and enjoy the humor!</li>
    <li>For two-part jokes, wait for the punchline to appear after a brief suspenseful pause</li>
  </ol>
  
  <h2>🤝 Contributing</h2>
  <p>Your contributions are welcome! Feel free to enhance this project:</p>
  <ol>
    <li>Fork the repository</li>
    <li>Create your feature branch (<code>git checkout -b feature/amazing-feature</code>)</li>
    <li>Commit your changes (<code>git commit -m 'Add some amazing feature'</code>)</li>
    <li>Push to the branch (<code>git push origin feature/amazing-feature</code>)</li>
    <li>Open a Pull Request</li>
  </ol>
  
  <h2>🌱 Future Improvements</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Add ability to save favorite jokes</li>
    <li>Implement dark/light theme toggle</li>
    <li>Create a joke rating system</li>
    <li>Add social media sharing functionality</li>
    <li>Implement text-to-speech for hearing jokes aloud</li>
  </ul>
  
  <h2>📝 License</h2>
  <p>This project is open source and available under the <a href="LICENSE">MIT License</a>.</p>
  
  <div class="footer">
    <p>Remember, laughter is the best medicine... unless you have a specific medical condition, in which case, please consult your doctor! 😄</p>
    <p>Built with <span class="heart">❤️</span> by <a href="https://github.com/deviljerry">deviljerry</a></p>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
  // Simple animation for the emoji
  const emoji = document.querySelector('.emoji');
  const emojis = ['😂', '🤣', '😆', '😄', '😁'];
  let currentIndex = 0;
  
  setInterval(() => {
    currentIndex = (currentIndex + 1) % emojis.length;
    emoji.textContent = emojis[currentIndex];
  }, 3000);
</script>
</body>
</html>
